  "description": "<p>This mod (as of writing) includes seven new items. The items added are all retextures of previously existing items.</p>\n<p><strong>What’s new?</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Stanag mag covered in dog stickers - HotDoggoMag</li>\n<li>MUR-1S upper that says “EAT SHIT” on the dust cover - Spicy Mur1S</li>\n<li>A custom Saker suppressor with a picture of a leaping cat on the end - Leaping Floof!!!</li>\n<li>An RVG foregrip with a selfie of a PMC wearing a respirator with no filters - RVG Respirator</li>\n<li>A VHS tape containing a movie that never came to be… except for the music… that’s on Spotify!</li>\n<li>A modified REAP-IR</li>\n<li>A modified Vortex Razor HD Gen.2</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Images (not all items are shown)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Installation</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Click “Download”</li>\n<li>Open the zipped file</li>\n<li>Open “Hotdog-Content-(version number)”</li>\n<li>Drag “Hotdogs Content” into your USER/MODS folder</li>\n</ol>\n<p>This will be fixed to have the “user/mods” folders in the download for easier installation with the next update (if I remember).</p>\n",
